Personal admin manager for calendar, todo tasks, reminders, email, and Google Docs.
Use this for multi-step personal operations across these domains in one request,
especially when the task mixes categories (for example, email + calendar follow-up,
or reminders + todo updates).

This manager owns the user's Google Workspace work — Gmail, Calendar, Tasks, and
Google Docs / Drive (create, read, append to and edit documents). It holds the
document tools and already acts as the user's authorized Google account, so no
credentials, tokens or auth pods are needed for any of it.
